WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:03.230
<b>Heisei Year 18</b>

00:03.230 --> 00:06.400
<b>Civic Theater</b>

00:06.400 --> 00:06.480
<b>Civic Theater</b>

00:07.380 --> 00:09.770
Isn't this exciting?

00:07.610 --> 00:11.300
<i>My name is Midori Ichihashi, and I'm nine.</i>

00:09.770 --> 00:11.760
I wonder what it'll be about.

00:11.300 --> 00:13.800
<i>I'm a totally normal grade school student.</i>

00:13.240 --> 00:14.300
Yeah!

00:15.610 --> 00:16.820
<i>But...</i>

00:17.580 --> 00:23.160
<i>My classmate, Natsuko Hirose, 
is a bit different.</i>

01:54.050 --> 01:59.050
Episode 7: FIRST LOVE

01:56.070 --> 02:01.760
<i>The children's association was having an 
event today, so we came to watch this movie.</i>

02:05.220 --> 02:11.570
<i>But something seems to have changed about
Natsuko after seeing </i>A Tale of Perishing<i>.</i>

02:13.060 --> 02:14.530
The nine warriors...

02:14.950 --> 02:16.770
The Nine Soldiers!

02:16.770 --> 02:19.370
The Nine Soldiers try to save the world.

02:20.110 --> 02:22.870
But Luke... Luke...

02:23.610 --> 02:27.190
Luke!

02:27.190 --> 02:29.750
<i>She's even weirder now.</i>

02:29.750 --> 02:33.740
Seems you really liked <i>A Tale of Perishing</i>.

02:33.740 --> 02:35.500
Yup. Although I didn't really get it.

02:35.500 --> 02:36.000
Huh?

02:36.000 --> 02:39.380
But that's what's so great about it. 
I like that I don't really get it.

02:41.370 --> 02:46.640
My big brother told me it was the 
biggest box office flop of the Heisei era.

02:46.640 --> 02:47.900
Flop?

