Braveheart</b>

02:59.400 --> 03:02.160
<b>King Brave Sword</b>

02:59.670 --> 03:02.160
<i>She's copying whole pages 
from an anime magazine?</i>

03:02.740 --> 03:04.170
What are you doing?

03:04.420 --> 03:08.120
Drawing the vision that's seared into 
the back of my mind with my eyes closed.

03:08.120 --> 03:09.060
What?

03:09.060 --> 03:12.680
I decided I'm going to be
 a virtuoso in the future.

