03:15.180 --> 03:18.390
The maker of <i>A Tale of Perishing</i>, 
Director Kametaro Tsuruyama,

03:18.390 --> 03:20.800
said she stayed up late 
every night making it.

03:21.180 --> 03:25.780
But I want to sleep at night, so I need 
to learn how to draw while I'm asleep.

03:25.780 --> 03:26.430
<i>Huh?</i>

03:26.680 --> 03:29.560
<i>But if you draw while asleep, 
that's like sleepwalking!</i>

03:29.780 --> 03:32.490
You're so weird, Natsuko.

03:32.490 --> 03:33.810
Right?

03:33.810 --> 03:35.770
Oh, yeah. I guess there's a test tomorrow.

03:35.770 --> 03:37.540
Aw, man. I forgot all about that.

03:41.110 --> 03:42.150
<i>But...</i>

03:45.580 --> 03:47.950
<i>No matter what everyone thinks of her...</i>

03:48.360 --> 03:51.450
<i>The fact that Natsuko's 
so obsessed with </i>A Tale of Perishing,<i></i>

03:54.720 --> 03:58.800
<i>and can give her all 
to something she loves...</i>

04:08.610 --> 04:09.990
<i>I think I...</i>

04:33.720 --> 04:34.920
<i>Squee!</i>

04:36.530 --> 04:37.790
So, um...

04:37.790 --> 04:40.610
Sadly, Miss Ichihashi is moving away.

04:43.800 --> 04:45.200
Take care, everyone.

04:45.610 --> 04:46.720
Midori.

04:47.810 --> 04:48.620
Here.

04:55.660 --> 04:59.350
I drew a picture of you and Luke 
that was seared into the back of my mind.

05:00.940 --> 05:02.940
<b>Natsuko Hirose</b>

05:01.250 --> 05:02.940
It's even signed by a virtuoso.

05:08.950 --> 05:10.700
<b>Natsuko Hirose</b>

05:14.150 --> 05:15.310
Wow.

05:27.180 --> 05:28.620
Thank you.

05:31.930 --> 05:34.930
<b>Always be positive and cheerful</b>

05:31.930 --> 05:34.930
<b>Take
\h\h\h\h\hcare</b>

05:31.930 --> 05:34.930
<b>Midori</b>

05:32.890 --> 05:34.090
<i>I think...</i>

05:35.420 --> 05:38.010
<i>that might've been my first love.</i>

05:39.940 --> 05:41.940
<b>Heisei Year 23</b>

05:49.150 --> 05:52.050
<i>My name is Shu Ninomiya, and I'm 14.</i>

05:52.050 --> 05:54.360
<i>I'm on the track team 
and going through puberty.</i>

05:54.700 --> 05:55.870
Wanna piece of me?!

05:55.870 --> 05:57.040
Huh?!

05:57.040 --> 05:57.830
Hey!

05:57.830 --> 05:59.370
Don't mess with me!

05:59.370 --> 06:00.480
What'd you say?

06:00.480 --> 06:01.500
Bastard!

06:00.720 --> 06:02.660
I need you two to take this seriously.

06:02.910 --> 06:03.970
What?

06:03.970 --> 06:07.060
Go on. Show me what it looks 
like when you punch someone.

06:07.280 --> 06:08.220
Come on. Hurry it up.

06:08.220 --> 06:08.790
Huh?

06:08.790 --> 06:14.010
I need you guys to actually 
draw blood here. Come <i>on</i>!

06:18.310 --> 06:20.940
<i>Natsuko Hirose, who's in my class,</i>

06:20.940 --> 06:23.690
<i>is completely different 
from all the other girls.</i>

06:28.700 --> 06:30.950
5 Magical Flavors

06:28.700 --> 06:30.950
<Chocolate Snack>

06:29.240 --> 06:32.360
I will be returning these 
to the school yard.

06:32.360 --> 06:35.880
What? But I wanted to 
research how bugs move.

06:38.610 --> 06:42.190
<i>Natsuko Hirose gets to school 
earlier than anyone else.</i>

06:42.460 --> 06:44.480
What are you drawing?

06:44.480 --> 06:47.480
I'm searing everything that moves 
into my brain and drawing it.

06:47.480 --> 06:48.410
Huh?

06:48.410 --> 06:50.640
In the Director Kametaro Tsuruyama issue,

06:50.640 --> 06:54.070
she says that's how she practiced
 drawing when she was young.

06:52.220 --> 06:55.220
<b>Kametaro
\h\h\hTsuruyama\h
\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFeature</b>

06:52.220 --> 06:55.220
<b>Virtuoso Kametaro
\h\hTsuruyama</b>

06:52.220 --> 06:55.220
<b>The Turbulent 40,000</b>

06:52.220 --> 06:55.220
<b>Character</b>

06:52.220 --> 06:55.220
<b>Interview</b>

06:54.070 --> 06:55.010
I see.

06:55.790 --> 07:01.550
<i>And the fact I'd get to school even 
earlier just to observe Natsuko Hirose</i>

07:01.550 --> 07:03.170
<i>was something no one else knew.</i>

07:04.240 --> 07:05.230
Ninomiya!

07:05.230 --> 07:05.940
Huh?

07:05.940 --> 07:09.030
Hirose's been staring at you
 this whole time.

07:09.030 --> 07:09.770
Huh?!

07:09.770 --> 07:12.100
Maybe she likes you.

07:12.100 --> 07:14.880
What?! Th-Th-Th-There's no way!

07:17.900 --> 07:19.570
Wh-What is it?

07:19.570 --> 07:23.470
Don't mind me. I'm just watching 
to see how your Adam's apple moves.

07:23.460 --> 07:26.380
<b>Milk</b>

07:23.740 --> 07:26.380
My Adam's apple?

07:26.690 --> 07:28.620
Just carry on like usual.

07:52.870 --> 07:54.150
<i>Natsuko Hirose...</i>

07:57.050 --> 07:58.660
<i>Natsuko Hirose...</i>

08:02.400 --> 08:15.310
<i>Natsuko... Hirose!</i>

08:29.860 --> 08:31.440
I need to talk to you.

08:31.940 --> 08:32.710
Huh?

08:35.280 --> 08:36.950
What?!

08:39.970 --> 08:41.450
So this...

08:41.670 --> 08:45.620
I'm wondering if once you become 
a virtuoso, running looks like this.

08:46.020 --> 08:48.640
I want you to run so fast
you produce an afterimage.

08:48.640 --> 08:49.710
Do you understand?

08:51.940 --> 08:52.700
Yup.

08:53.200 --> 08:54.930
<i>I didn't understand at all.</i>

08:58.020 --> 09:00.220
<i>But even so, I ran.</i>

09:00.220 --> 09:04.260
Faster! Are you even <i>trying</i> 
to produce an afterimage?

09:04.550 --> 09:05.220
<i>I mean...</i>

09:14.130 --> 09:15.160
<i>I...</i>

09:19.830 --> 09:20.940
Faster.

09:20.940 --> 09:22.410
Even faster!

09:23.410 --> 09:25.900
Show me that afterimage!

09:26.840 --> 09:29.210
<i>Natsuko Hirose, I...</i>

09:34.030 --> 09:35.240
<i>Squee!</i>

09:35.240 --> 09:39.890
Faster!

09:45.390 --> 09:53.430
<i>I love you!</i>

09:58.020 --> 10:04.980
<i>Before I knew it, I'd gotten so fast, I ended up
 setting a new 100m record at prefecturals.</i>

10:07.550 --> 10:09.860
<i>I made up my mind to tell her how I felt.</i>

10:10.260 --> 10:11.170
Hirose!

10:12.020 --> 10:12.970
What?

10:13.440 --> 10:16.830
Hey, you're gonna come watch 
our practice again today, right?

10:17.180 --> 10:19.220
There's something I want 
to say to you after—

10:19.220 --> 10:20.190
I'm not going anymore.

10:20.190 --> 10:20.800
Huh?

10:21.170 --> 10:25.440
Oh, but I set a new record,
 and I'm in peak condition right now.

10:27.270 --> 10:28.560
Congrats...

10:28.560 --> 10:29.680
Nishimura.

10:33.090 --> 10:34.850
But my name's Ninomiya.

10:37.790 --> 10:42.530
<i>Apparently, Natsuko Hirose was satisfied with 
just being able to draw the action of running.</i>

10:42.770 --> 10:45.500
Go on! Burn more!

10:45.500 --> 10:47.540
You're not getting fired-up enough!

10:47.540 --> 10:50.630
Show me those roaring flames!

10:50.630 --> 10:52.260
That's not enough!

10:50.630 --> 10:54.550
<i>And my first love ended 
in a blink of an eye.</i>

10:52.770 --> 10:55.270
I <i>know</i> you can do better than that!

10:56.760 --> 10:59.260
<b>Heisei Year 26</b>

11:03.760 --> 11:11.270
<b>ART</b>

11:03.770 --> 11:06.000
<i>I'm Saburo Aoi.</i>

11:06.350 --> 11:11.260
I'm 20, and set to be a great director who 
will carry the anime world on his shoulders.

