Then, first, could you draw the 
in-betweens for these two key frames?

12:30.380 --> 12:33.710
Oh, in-betweens are the drawings 
in between two key frames and—

12:33.710 --> 12:34.570
I'm aware.

12:34.570 --> 12:37.070
Oh, I-I see. Right.

12:37.070 --> 12:40.570
Then, here. This is the song
 for the music video.

12:40.570 --> 12:43.390
