you don't understand.

12:45.980 --> 12:48.820
<i>This novice doesn't even 
know what a pegbar is.</i>

12:49.110 --> 12:52.830
<i>I mean, who knows 
if she even actually drew that?</i>

12:52.830 --> 12:56.140
