13:11.770 --> 13:15.280
<i>ignoring my key frames!</i>

13:15.280 --> 13:16.990
You're so good, Hirose.

13:16.990 --> 13:18.300
And you're fast.

13:18.300 --> 13:19.900
You're a lifesaver.

