\h\hwhere...</b>

18:04.520 --> 18:06.690
<b>Squee...</b>

18:04.520 --> 18:06.690
<b>...our story began.</b>

18:06.250 --> 18:08.180
And what the hell is "Squee," anyway?

18:06.690 --> 18:08.190
<b>Squee...</b>

18:08.190 --> 18:10.610
What's that sound even supposed to be?

18:11.510 --> 18:14.450
<i>That's it. Let it vex you.</i>

18:14.450 --> 18:17.190
<i>Let it eat at you and 
dive into your first love, Natsuko.</i>

18:17.500 --> 18:19.830
Could you please do something about Hirose?

18:19.820 --> 18:23.580
<b>Konkon</b>

18:20.150 --> 18:21.540
What's wrong with Natsuko?

18:21.540 --> 18:23.570
What? You don't know?

18:24.600 --> 18:26.060
Do you have a second?

18:28.810 --> 18:32.000
Are you two experiencing your first love?

18:33.780 --> 18:35.130
Your first love.

18:35.760 --> 18:38.250
Can you show it to me?

18:40.550 --> 18:44.720
Someone in the neighborhood reported 
a strange woman causing a stir to the police.

18:44.720 --> 18:46.400
And that's not all!

18:46.620 --> 18:48.260
Wow, I'm late.

18:51.390 --> 18:52.100
Ow!

18:53.140 --> 18:54.020
Well?

18:54.020 --> 18:54.730
Huh?

18:55.820 --> 18:57.780
Did you get that "squee" feeling?

18:56.980 --> 18:58.530
Wh-What?

18:58.530 --> 19:02.780
Every single day, she runs at me as fast as 
she can with a piece of toast in her mouth!

19:03.280 --> 19:04.540
On top of that!

19:04.950 --> 19:07.110
You have your "first love" on you, right?

19:08.160 --> 19:09.290
No.

19:09.290 --> 19:11.930
Show me your "squee."

19:11.930 --> 19:14.110
No, really. I don't have it.

19:15.780 --> 19:18.290
She even mugged me for my first love.

19:18.290 --> 19:20.510
Could you please do something about her?

19:21.450 --> 19:23.380
Just face it head-on.

19:23.980 --> 19:24.810
Huh?

19:25.430 --> 19:28.430
Natsuko's giving her best, 
so just face it head-on.

19:28.840 --> 19:31.130
She needs this.

19:33.560 --> 19:35.150
A little gift

19:33.560 --> 19:35.150
Fight!

19:33.560 --> 19:35.150
From the President

19:33.560 --> 19:35.150
<i>Natsuko Hirose...</i>

19:35.640 --> 19:39.060
<i>There's one thing you're severely lacking.</i>

19:39.550 --> 19:42.410
<i>And I'm certain you'll be able to find it.</i>

19:50.190 --> 19:51.630
Um...

19:52.040 --> 19:54.930
About the candidates 
for animation directors...

19:54.930 --> 19:57.080
Here's the list.

19:57.080 --> 19:58.650
I'll be the animation director.

19:58.650 --> 20:02.530
Huh? But you've already got 
so much on your plate, Director,

20:02.530 --> 20:05.880
so the president said to have 
someone else be the animation director...

20:05.880 --> 20:07.060
I'll do it.

20:07.280 --> 20:09.060
Get over yourself.

20:09.060 --> 20:12.310
Don't act like you're making 
this all by yourself.

20:13.810 --> 20:15.310
<b>Konkon</b>

20:16.110 --> 20:18.790
<i>Natsuko, this is your moment of truth.</i>

20:26.190 --> 20:27.830
Nothing's coming to me.

20:29.760 --> 20:31.590
Of course, President.

20:33.880 --> 20:35.580
Natsuko! What's wrong?

20:35.800 --> 20:37.390
Don't die, Natsuko!

20:37.980 --> 20:41.880
Your first love hasn't even begun yet!

20:45.010 --> 20:47.500
The preparations for 
the tea party are complete.

20:45.590 --> 20:47.310
Hey! Wait, wait, wait.

20:47.310 --> 20:50.510
Ugh, I said stop!

20:50.510 --> 20:53.520
<i>Man, that was a scary dream.</i>

20:50.760 --> 20:54.070
Okay, okay.

20:55.600 --> 20:56.140
So good!

20:56.350 --> 20:59.180
Nacchan, that hairpin's so cute.

20:59.180 --> 21:01.520
I told you to give me my horn back!

21:01.750 --> 21:04.650
Oh, whatever. It's gonna grow right back.

21:04.650 --> 21:07.150
Here, Natsuko. Eat this.

21:04.920 --> 21:08.070
Dang it. I'm massaging my head all the time.

21:07.270 --> 21:09.680
Yay! Thanks for the food!

21:09.680 --> 21:10.930
So good!

21:10.930 --> 21:11.920
What is it?

21:11.110 --> 21:13.330
<i>I see how it is.</i>

21:11.920 --> 21:13.330
A deep-fried fava bean paste.

21:13.340 --> 21:14.630
It's Justice.

21:13.880 --> 21:15.090
It's a real dragon!

21:15.090 --> 21:17.470
They're huge fans of yours, Juschan.

21:18.580 --> 21:20.030
J-Juschan?

21:20.030 --> 21:23.030
Go play with Juschan while you can.

21:23.030 --> 21:24.220
Yay!

21:23.030 --> 21:24.220
H-Hey, wait.

21:24.220 --> 21:26.610
You're so popular, Juschan.

21:24.530 --> 21:26.610
Hey, hey, hey...

21:26.610 --> 21:29.470
Could you pass that bread, Juschan?

21:28.850 --> 21:30.020
S-Stop that.

21:30.020 --> 21:32.930
Stop. I said stop that!

21:34.820 --> 21:41.240
Juschan? Juschan? Juschan? Juschan?

21:39.610 --> 21:42.960
Guess your name's Juschan 
now. Right, Juschan?

21:41.230 --> 21:43.910
It just rolls off the tongue.

21:48.210 --> 21:49.240
<i>Huh?</i>

21:50.460 --> 21:53.100
<i>Is </i>A Tale of Perishing<i>...</i>

21:55.570 --> 21:57.910
<i>supposed to be this happy?</i>

21:58.710 --> 22:00.760
Hey, so I overheard you say it earlier...

22:00.760 --> 22:02.480
What's this "Unio Special"?

22:00.820 --> 22:01.590
What?

22:02.900 --> 22:05.620
The Unio Special? Oh, right. 
I haven't shown you that yet.

22:05.620 --> 22:06.630
Oh, come on.

22:06.630 --> 22:10.480
Pardon me, everyone. 
Does anyone want seconds?

22:07.060 --> 22:10.480
It's a few root veggies, and fava beans.

22:08.720 --> 22:09.630
Well, whatever.

22:10.480 --> 22:13.720
What root veggies are in it exactly?

22:10.480 --> 22:14.380
There's still plenty of food.

22:16.570 --> 22:18.010
Of course it's not.

22:18.010 --> 22:18.670
Huh?

